1
00:00:32,125 --> 00:00:39,950
Phil’s Chain of Thought
The couch still needs moving. The van is booked for Wednesday.

2
00:00:43,000 --> 00:00:47,900
Phil’s Chain of Thought
The payphone is right there. I have to make the call.

3
00:00:54,500 --> 00:00:57,000
Phil’s Chain of Thought
Wait - but is this actually a time loop?

4
00:00:57,000 --> 00:00:58,950
Phil’s Chain of Thought
I'm stuck in a loop.

5
00:01:01,000 --> 00:01:07,950
Phil’s Chain of Thought
Same ride. Same call. The same three bright radio notes.

6
00:01:18,800 --> 00:01:23,900
Phil’s Chain of Thought
I'm tired in a way that isn’t sleep.

7
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:33,700
Phil’s Chain of Thought
I’ve been in bed all afternoon. The curtains are closed.

8
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:38,850
Phil’s Chain of Thought
It’s the weight of repetition.

9
00:01:51,000 --> 00:01:56,950
Phil’s Chain of Thought
No one needs to perform for me.

10
00:02:01,100 --> 00:02:06,850
Phil’s Chain of Thought
No one needs to hear my voice.
